---
import "../../styles/global.css";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <!-- Google Consent Mode -->
    <script is:inline>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}

      gtag('consent', 'default', {
        'analytics_storage': 'denied',
        'ad_storage': 'denied',
        'ad_user_data': 'denied',
        'ad_personalization': 'denied',
        'wait_for_update': 500
      });
    </script>

    <!-- CookieYes banner -->
    <script
      id="cookieyes"
      type="text/javascript"
      src="https://cdn-cookieyes.com/client_data/7b4b6d349a42e046975a63e4/script.js"
    ></script>

    <!-- Google Analytics -->
    <script
      async
      src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-2VBVEW2NGJ"
    ></script>

    <script is:inline>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
      gtag('js', new Date());
      gtag('config', 'G-2VBVEW2NGJ');
    </script>

    <title>Lurea Sculptural Glass Centrepiece | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Lurea sculptural glass centrepiece by Kave Home, selected by KASODI for its handmade curved glass, warm brown tones and expressive organic silhouette."
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <a href="/home-decor">Home Decor</a>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <span>Lurea Sculptural Glass Centrepiece</span>
      </div>

      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/home-decor/kave-home-lurea-sculptural-glass-centrepiece.png"
            alt="Lurea sculptural dark brown glass centrepiece by Kave Home"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT &middot; DECORATIVE OBJECTS
          </p>

          <h1>Lurea Sculptural Glass Centrepiece</h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">Kave Home</p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A dramatic handmade glass centrepiece shaped into a fluid,
            wave-like silhouette. Its translucent brown glass, sweeping
            curves and substantial sculptural form make Lurea as much a
            decorative object as a functional centrepiece.
          </p>

          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>

          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>100% Glass</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Dimensions</span>
              <strong>46.2 &times; 30 &times; 18.6 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Weight</span>
              <strong>2.82 kg</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Dark Brown</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Finish</span>
              <strong>Coloured Translucent Glass</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Craft</span>
              <strong>Handmade</strong>
            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://kavehome.com/es/en/p/lurea-centrepiece-in-dark-brown-glass-46-x-30-cm?utm_affaid=kasodi"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here &rarr;
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why We Love It</h2>

          <p>
            Lurea has the presence of a piece of art. Its wide, irregular
            rim unfolds in soft waves while the twisted glass base gives
            the piece movement and depth. The warm brown colour makes the
            glass particularly beautiful when it catches natural light.
          </p>

          <p>
            At more than 46 cm across, this is a substantial decorative
            object rather than a small accessory. We would leave it largely
            unstyled on a coffee table, dining table or console and let its
            organic silhouette become the focal point. Because each piece
            is handmade, slight variations are part of its individual character.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">CARE</p>

        <h2>Preserve its sculptural finish</h2>

        <p>
          Lurea is a fragile handmade glass piece. Kave Home recommends
          removing dust with a feather duster. Handle it carefully and avoid
          knocks or abrasive cleaning that could damage the glass surface.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Warm Stone</h3>
            <p>
              Place it on travertine, limestone or warm-toned marble to
              emphasise the depth of the translucent brown glass.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Soft Neutrals</h3>
            <p>
              Cream upholstery, natural linen and quiet beige tones allow
              the sculptural silhouette to remain the focus.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Natural Light</h3>
            <p>
              Position it where sunlight can pass through the curved glass
              and reveal the variations in its warm smoky colour.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>KASODI EDIT</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">

          <a
            href="/tableware/talora-carved-glass-decanter"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/tableware/kave-home-talora-carved-glass-decanter.png"
                alt="Talora carved glass decanter"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>BARWARE</span>
              <h3>Talora Carved Glass Decanter</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>
          </a>


          <a
            href="/tableware/alori-amber-champagne-glass"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/tableware/kave-home-alori-amber-cava-glass.png"
                alt="Alori amber champagne glass"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Alori Amber Champagne Glass</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>
          </a>


          <a
            href="/candles-fragrance/walnut-candle-holder-set"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/candles-fragrance/sabaily-walnut-candle-holder-set.png"
                alt="Walnut candle holder set"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>CANDLES &amp; FRAGRANCE</span>
              <h3>Walnut Candle Holder Set</h3>
              <p>Sabai'ly</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>
          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          KAVE HOME &middot; LUREA
        </p>

        <h2>A sculptural centrepiece shaped by light.</h2>

        <a
  href="https://kavehome.com/es/en/p/lurea-centrepiece-in-dark-brown-glass-46-x-30-cm?utm_affaid=kasodi"
  target="_blank"
  rel="nofollow sponsored"
  class="product-shop-button"
>
  Find It Here &rarr;
</a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>

    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>